    "title": "Immediate Requirement Logistics Manager at MSC India Advisory Limited",
    "description": "MSC India Advisory Limited, one of India's leading organizations, is hiring a Logistics Manager for our Chennai operations. We offer a competitive salary package along with world-class benefits.\n\nAbout MSC India Advisory Limited:\nMSC India Advisory Limited is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Prepare MIS reports on delivery performance and SLA adherence\n• Implement cost-saving initiatives in transportation and warehousing\n• Oversee end-to-end logistics operations for timely delivery\n• Manage reverse logistics and return merchandise authorization\n• Manage a fleet of vehicles and coordinate with drivers\n• Implement warehouse management systems (WMS) and track KPIs\n• Optimize delivery routes to reduce cost and improve efficiency\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• MBA from a recognized university\n• 1-3 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in MS Excel\n• Proficiency in Fleet Management\n• Proficiency in Data Analytics\n• Proficiency in Freight Forwarding\n• Proficiency in Supply Chain Management\n• Proficiency in Customs Clearance\n• Proficiency in SAP SCM\n• Proficiency in GPS Tracking Systems\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Learning & development budget\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Salary Range: 4 LPA - 9 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Chennai, Tamil Nadu, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with MSC India Advisory Limited!",
